<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 106,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 106,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Wednesday were 106,000 head, compared with the estimate of 110,000, USDA reported. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady to $0.50 per cwt lower than midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.00 -55.50	   55.00 -56.50</p>
<p>few			53.50 -56.00		   -57.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs   42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs-up	     46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
